      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent 4: Image Designer (Baserow → Sanity)\n\nPolls copy_written every 5 min → Claude motif → OpenAI gpt-image-1 (1536x1024; all display surfaces crop to 16:9) — switched 2026-06-11, Gemini key was dead in the FIXED house style (dark-green editorial line art, picked 2026-06-10; keep in sync with website/scripts/gen-blog-covers.mjs) → uploads to Sanity assets (credential: Sanity Write Token) → Cover Image URL + ready_to_publish.\n\nImgbb removed 2026-06-10 (hardcoded key, off-brand covers).",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 560
      }
    },
